  ],
  "pseudocode": "1. Set = new Set(to_delete)\n2. forest = []\n3. function dfs(node, isRoot):\n4.   if !node: return null\n5.   delete = Set.has(node.val)\n6.   if isRoot && !delete: forest.push(node)\n7.   node.left = dfs(node.left, delete)\n8.   node.right = dfs(node.right, delete)\n9.   return delete ? null : node",
